Package: posMatchR
Type: Package
Title: Annotate Single-Nucleotide RNA Sites and Build Matched Backgrounds
Version: 0.1.10
Authors@R: person("Sarah", "Ku", email = "sarah.ku@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for annotating single-nucleotide GRanges objects with transcript, gene,
    region, metagene, sequence-context, and feature-distance variables, and for constructing
    matched background sets for post-transcriptional site analyses such as RNA modifications,
    RNA editing, and RBP binding-site maps.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
